{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_txngve2b63oyishd7vqbgzoo4yunjmr5rkwrmlzyrnczeecz4bga","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01U3sxC8pxm596rnJteRJ5Tf","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> CONFIGS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## A second harness defect the negative control exposed\n\nAfter the first sweep populated `target/debug/libdriver.so`, the mutation control\nsuddenly reported the `src/lib.rs` mutations (`printLine` NULL check inverted,\n`printIntLine` negated, `main` returning 1) as **MISSED**. The mutations were\nreal; the harness was not testing them.\n\nCause: `cargo test --test differential` builds only the *test* target — it does\n**not** rebuild the `lib`/`bin` targets. `ensure_rust_artifacts()` reused a\npre-existing `target/<profile>/libdriver.so` if one was present, so the suite\nhappily loaded and compared a **stale** shared object that predated the changes\nin `src/`. Every test passed while verifying nothing.\n\nFixed by having `ensure_rust_artifacts()` rebuild the `cdylib` and `bin`\nunconditionally into a dedicated `CARGO_TARGET_DIR`, plus an explicit staleness\nguard that panics if either artifact's mtime is older than any file in `src/`.\nWith that, the control is back to **21 caught / 0 missed**.\n\nWorth recording as a general lesson: \"all tests pass\" is only meaningful once you\nhave checked that the tests can fail.\nEOF\necho \"--- artifacts ---\"; wc -l SYMBOLS.md ERRORS.md CONFIGS.md tests/differential.rs mutation_check.sh run_all_configs.sh src/imp.rs src/lib.rs src/main.rs\necho \"--- libloading in dev-deps ---\"; grep -A3 'dev-dependencies' Cargo.toml\necho \"--- warnings ---\"; touch src/*.rs tests/*.rs && timeout 300 cargo check --offline --all-targets 2>&1 | grep -cE \"^(warning|error)\" ","description":"Document finding and verify all artifacts"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1087,"cache_read_input_tokens":204242,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1087,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2b024b3b-d43e-48e6-afdf-98073f78444a","uuid":"a087232f-36a4-4806-9845-c7915a85ede9","timestamp":"2026-08-18T02:41:44.633Z"}
